# Reclaim — environment variables
#
# Mapbox publishable token (starts with pk.). When set, the board map,
# report pin-picker, item mini-map, and admin heatmap render live Mapbox tiles.
# When empty, the app falls back to the built-in styled map (no token needed).
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Paste your token below
# 3. Restart `npm run dev`
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
